OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread mist and fog across
OL,6,Fthe region, although upland areas will
OL,7,Flikely be clear. This slowly lifts and
OL,8,Fclears through the morning to leave a
OL,9,Freasonable afternoon, although the odd
OL,10,Fpatch may linger. Light winds. Mild
OL,11,Fwhere fog clears.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA clear evening with mist and
OL,14,Ffog redeveloping quickly particularly
OL,15,Fthrough Lincolnshire, becoming
OL,16,Fwidespread by the end of the night.
OL,17,FTurning cool under any clear spells.
OL,18,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
